###############################################################################
#  DEMO AKIŞI (~3 dk) — her isteği yeşil ▶ ile TEK TEK çalıştır
#  Numaralar demo dokümanındaki adımlarla aynı.
#  Tam test seti için: istekler.http (Run All)
#  Aynı istekleri tarayıcıdan denemek ve curl almak için: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html
###############################################################################


### 1) Public sağlık kontrolü → 200 "ok"
GET http://localhost:8080/api/public/health


### 2) Token yok → 401 JSON (gövdedeki message'ı göster)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/violations


### 3) Login: admin → 200 + token (token'ı jwt.io'ya yapıştır)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin", "password": "admin123"}

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.accessToken); %}


### 4) Login: yanlış parola → 401 "Kullanıcı adı veya parola hatalı"
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin", "password": "yanlis"}


### 5a) Login: user → 200 + token
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "user", "password": "user123"}

> {% client.global.set("userToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 5b) USER ile tüm liste → 403 (401 kimlik, 403 yetki)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/violations
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### 6a) USER kendi ihlalleri → 200 (sadece 34A0261: id 1 ve 4)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/violations/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 6b) USER başkasının kaydı (34B0102) → 403 (karar veriden)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/violations/2
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### 7a) Login: operator → 200 + token
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "operator", "password": "operator123"}

> {% client.global.set("operatorToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 7b) OPERATOR ile ekleme → 403 (okuyabilir, yazamaz)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/violations
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"plate": "35C0001", "date": "2026-11-20", "amount": 40.00}

### 7c) ADMIN ile ekleme → 201  (sonra H2: SELECT * FROM violations)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/violations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"plate": "35C0001", "date": "2026-11-20", "amount": 40.00}

> {% client.global.set("newId", response.body.id); %}

### 7d) ADMIN ile silme → 204
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/violations/{{newId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 8) İmzası bozuk token (sona tek harf) → 401 "Invalid signature"
GET http://localhost:8080/api/violations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}x


### 9) Süresi dolmuş token (imzası geçerli, exp: 2026-11-18T09:00Z) → 401 "Jwt expired"
GET http://localhost:8080/api/violations/mine
